        "tags": [
          "Authentication"
        ],
        "summary": "Generate an antiforgery token",
        "description": "Issues a request antiforgery token and sets the associated antiforgery cookie (__Host-TeacherOS.Antiforgery). To perform state-changing mutations (POST, PATCH, DELETE), include the returned token in the X-CSRF-TOKEN request header alongside the antiforgery cookie.",
